1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000


2
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:09,800
Your daughter

3
00:03:09,880 --> 00:03:12,120
did something wrong.
She slapped my daughter.

4
00:03:12,200 --> 00:03:15,240
Now I understand why
your daughter is so vicious.

5
00:03:15,320 --> 00:03:16,960
She has a mother like you.

6
00:03:17,040 --> 00:03:18,160
What are you gonna do?

7
00:03:18,760 --> 00:03:21,040
Try me and find out.

8
00:03:21,120 --> 00:03:23,000
Hathaya wants to steal Raiwin.

9
00:03:23,080 --> 00:03:24,240
PREVIOUSLY

10
00:03:24,320 --> 00:03:27,440
If anything happens to Hathaya,
you're responsible.

11
00:03:28,400 --> 00:03:29,840
By the time he finds her…

12
00:03:31,480 --> 00:03:32,600
Don't touch me.

13
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:35,560
Enough. Enough!

14
00:03:42,840 --> 00:03:44,400
Hurry up.

15
00:03:44,480 --> 00:03:47,000
If you want me to let him go,

16
00:03:47,920 --> 00:03:48,880
then come here.

17
00:03:50,760 --> 00:03:52,640
No. Hathaya.

18
00:03:52,720 --> 00:03:54,240
Hathaya, don't!

19
00:03:54,320 --> 00:03:55,800
Hold him down.

20
00:03:56,640 --> 00:03:58,200
Hathaya, don't go.

21
00:03:58,280 --> 00:04:00,800
Come on. Don't make this difficult.

22
00:04:01,920 --> 00:04:04,320
I don't like women who refuse me.

23
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:06,720
Come on. I don't like that.

24
00:04:09,360 --> 00:04:11,840
Madam. Miss Chayanee.

25
00:04:24,320 --> 00:04:26,240
-Hathaya. Hathaya.
-Come on.

26
00:04:27,200 --> 00:04:28,320
Don't.

27
00:04:29,360 --> 00:04:30,440
Come here.

28
00:04:30,520 --> 00:04:31,760
Let go…

29
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:38,600
Turn around and look at him.

30
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:50,000
Turn back here.

31
00:04:50,080 --> 00:04:52,080
Let her go!

32
00:04:54,360 --> 00:04:55,280
Don't!

33
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:02,320
Hey. Where are you going?

34
00:05:07,360 --> 00:05:10,040
I heard someone screaming
at the construction site.

35
00:05:10,120 --> 00:05:11,400
I'm going to check it out.

36
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:14,800
There's nothing in there.
But the power went out in the office.

37
00:05:14,880 --> 00:05:17,920
I went inside, and everything
was scattered everywhere.

38
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:20,240
I think a thief
may still be hiding in there.

39
00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:22,560
Can you go help catch them?
I'll give you ten grand.

40
00:05:22,640 --> 00:05:24,640
Go.

41
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:28,520
-Go.
-Go ahead.

42
00:05:30,720 --> 00:05:32,640
No!

43
00:05:47,360 --> 00:05:48,360
Run.

44
00:05:48,440 --> 00:05:51,080
Hathaya. Run.

45
00:05:51,160 --> 00:05:52,640
Help! Help!

46
00:05:52,720 --> 00:05:54,360
-Go after her.
-Help!

47
00:05:58,360 --> 00:05:59,880
Think you're tough?

48
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:05,560
-Go already.
-Help!

49
00:06:09,320 --> 00:06:10,640
Miss Hathaya.

50
00:06:15,480 --> 00:06:17,160
Help!

51
00:06:17,240 --> 00:06:18,920
Help!

52
00:06:21,720 --> 00:06:23,960
Let go. Let me go!

53
00:06:24,040 --> 00:06:26,600
-Let me go!
-Miss Hathaya!

54
00:06:26,680 --> 00:06:28,280
-Hey!
-Get them!

55
00:06:29,280 --> 00:06:32,920
Max. Please help Ramil. Ramil is inside.

56
00:06:36,200 --> 00:06:38,480
-Hey!
-What?!

57
00:06:38,560 --> 00:06:40,360
Get out of here!

58
00:06:41,520 --> 00:06:43,200
Ramil, are you okay?

59
00:06:43,280 --> 00:06:45,200
-Ramil. Ramil!
-Boss!

60
00:06:45,920 --> 00:06:46,760
Boss.

61
00:06:46,840 --> 00:06:49,880
-Boss. Boss.
-Ramil…

62
00:06:49,960 --> 00:06:51,560
Max, what do we do?

63
00:06:51,640 --> 00:06:52,640
-Max.
-Boss.

64
00:06:53,280 --> 00:06:54,840
Boss! Wake up.

65
00:06:54,920 --> 00:06:56,520
Hey!

66
00:06:56,600 --> 00:06:58,160
-Go after them!
-Yes.

67
00:06:58,240 --> 00:06:59,480
Boss.

68
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:02,280
Boss.

69
00:07:02,840 --> 00:07:04,080
Boss, wake up.

70
00:07:07,840 --> 00:07:10,480
Ramil…

71
00:07:11,200 --> 00:07:12,720
Mom. Aunt Chamoi.

72
00:07:12,800 --> 00:07:14,240
Call an ambulance.

73
00:07:19,320 --> 00:07:20,200
Call one.

74
00:07:21,240 --> 00:07:23,960
-Call an ambulance.
-Yes. Yes.

75
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:25,360
Hurry!

76
00:07:25,440 --> 00:07:26,880
No one's answering yet.

77
00:07:28,880 --> 00:07:29,960
Boss.

78
00:07:32,440 --> 00:07:33,560
Ramil.

79
00:07:34,160 --> 00:07:36,200
Please wake up.

80
00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:48,680
Boss.

81
00:07:50,320 --> 00:07:52,680
You don't have to hold me up.
I can walk by myself now.

82
00:07:52,760 --> 00:07:54,200
Yeah,

83
00:07:54,280 --> 00:07:56,400
I guess that IV really
gave you some strength.

84
00:07:56,480 --> 00:07:57,600
Ow.

85
00:07:58,280 --> 00:08:01,160
-Ugh.
-Max.

86
00:08:01,240 --> 00:08:03,680
Did you make any food?
I need to eat before I take my meds.

87
00:08:03,760 --> 00:08:07,360
I had to drive all the way to pick you up.
When was I supposed to cook?

88
00:08:07,440 --> 00:08:09,280
Then we can order something.

89
00:08:09,360 --> 00:08:11,040
I already made food for you.

90
00:08:12,240 --> 00:08:14,200
Perfect. I'm starving.

91
00:08:16,360 --> 00:08:21,040
Max, you can go home now.
I can take care of myself.

92
00:08:22,920 --> 00:08:26,280
Now that someone's caring for you,
you're kicking me out?

93
00:08:26,360 --> 00:08:27,920
Not even asking me to stay for lunch?

94
00:08:29,600 --> 00:08:31,920
-Max.
-Yes?

95
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:35,240
I made some for you too.

96
00:08:35,320 --> 00:08:37,280
Miss Hathaya.

97
00:08:37,360 --> 00:08:39,919
Are you throwing me out too?

98
00:08:40,559 --> 00:08:44,280
No. I know you have to supervise
the site while Ramil is recovering.

99
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:45,640
So I made some for you.

100
00:08:46,400 --> 00:08:48,320
Come on. Go.

101
00:08:48,400 --> 00:08:51,040
-I'm counting on you.
-Move your leg.

102
00:08:51,640 --> 00:08:53,560
Thank you.

103
00:08:54,480 --> 00:08:56,640
-Can't eat here, huh?
-Just go.

104
00:09:28,240 --> 00:09:30,760
Eat something. You need food
before taking your medicine.

105
00:09:32,280 --> 00:09:34,760
It still hurts.

106
00:09:35,360 --> 00:09:37,400
Whenever I hold a spoon,

107
00:09:38,200 --> 00:09:39,880
I get this sharp pain in my wrist.

108
00:09:44,440 --> 00:09:45,280
‎That's right.

109
00:09:46,560 --> 00:09:49,920
You were beaten all over.

110
00:09:51,040 --> 00:09:52,320
You can barely feed yourself.

111
00:09:52,400 --> 00:09:54,120
That's probably it.

112
00:09:55,040 --> 00:09:56,240
Then…

113
00:09:57,240 --> 00:09:59,600
I'll take you back to the hospital.
You can be admitted

114
00:09:59,680 --> 00:10:01,840
and get nursing care and an IV.

115
00:10:03,920 --> 00:10:06,640
I was there for two days already.
It was boring.

116
00:10:08,360 --> 00:10:09,840
I can feed myself.

117
00:10:15,840 --> 00:10:16,760
I'll get you a straw.

118
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:27,560
Do you like it hot?

119
00:10:27,640 --> 00:10:30,760
Blow on it too. My mouth hurts. See?

120
00:10:40,360 --> 00:10:41,640
It's coming out.

121
00:10:46,440 --> 00:10:48,760
Thank you for taking such good care of me.

122
00:10:49,400 --> 00:10:50,760
I feel like a VIP.

123
00:10:53,400 --> 00:10:55,920
You got hurt because you came to help me.

124
00:10:57,520 --> 00:10:58,920
I really am grateful.

125
00:11:02,160 --> 00:11:05,560
I never thought something this bad
could happen at the development.

126
00:11:06,720 --> 00:11:08,960
They called and tricked me into leaving.

127
00:11:09,040 --> 00:11:10,880
They planned everything carefully.

128
00:11:11,560 --> 00:11:13,680
Do you suspect anyone?

129
00:11:15,960 --> 00:11:17,480
I don't know.

130
00:11:17,560 --> 00:11:20,280
I don't want to accuse anyone
without evidence.

131
00:11:22,080 --> 00:11:25,440
Don't worry. I'll keep
following up with the police.

132
00:11:26,480 --> 00:11:27,680
Hope they're caught soon.

133
00:11:32,080 --> 00:11:34,480
You'll have no strength
if you don't eat enough.

134
00:11:35,160 --> 00:11:36,600
-Want more?
-No, too much.

135
00:11:38,120 --> 00:11:40,400
-Did you blow on it?
-Yes.

136
00:11:44,440 --> 00:11:47,200
-Are you full yet?
-No. That was only two bites.

137
00:11:49,600 --> 00:11:52,240
Father is furious about what happened.

138
00:11:52,320 --> 00:11:54,400
He told the police
to move faster on the case.

139
00:11:55,200 --> 00:11:57,040
Make sure your men stay well hidden,

140
00:11:57,120 --> 00:11:58,680
or it will be a big problem.

141
00:11:58,760 --> 00:12:00,160
Don't worry.

142
00:12:00,240 --> 00:12:02,480
My men are professionals.

143
00:12:03,320 --> 00:12:04,680
The vehicle we used was rented,

144
00:12:04,760 --> 00:12:06,000
and the plate--

145
00:12:06,080 --> 00:12:10,880
Did I hurt you? The plate was fake.
So there's nothing to worry about.

146
00:12:10,960 --> 00:12:12,240
Don't get careless.

147
00:12:12,320 --> 00:12:16,200
And if anything happens,
don't drag me into it.

148
00:12:17,600 --> 00:12:21,040
You've treated me so well, madam.

149
00:12:21,120 --> 00:12:22,400
I'd never turn on you.

150
00:12:23,400 --> 00:12:25,560
If we can't get rid of Hathaya,

151
00:12:25,640 --> 00:12:27,360
then we'll go after her mother instead.

152
00:12:36,120 --> 00:12:37,240
I'm already so stressed.

153
00:12:59,720 --> 00:13:01,480
He made plans with me and didn't show up.

154
00:13:02,440 --> 00:13:03,880
He won't answer my calls either.

155
00:13:04,840 --> 00:13:06,400
Why is he acting like this?

156
00:13:17,120 --> 00:13:18,880
Hello, Hathai.

157
00:13:18,960 --> 00:13:23,920
Yes, Yai. That night, I went
to meet you like we planned.

158
00:13:24,000 --> 00:13:27,640
You never showed up. Then I tried
calling you, but I couldn't reach you.

159
00:13:27,720 --> 00:13:29,080
Where have you been?

160
00:13:29,160 --> 00:13:31,000
I'm really sorry.

161
00:13:31,080 --> 00:13:32,440
That night…

162
00:13:32,520 --> 00:13:33,840
What happened?

163
00:13:33,920 --> 00:13:36,760
I was planning to buy you
a diamond necklace,

164
00:13:36,840 --> 00:13:38,720
but on the way there, I was robbed.

165
00:13:38,800 --> 00:13:42,040
They beat me up and took the necklace.

166
00:13:42,800 --> 00:13:45,560
I was in the hospital for a while
and couldn't contact anyone.

167
00:13:45,640 --> 00:13:49,480
As soon as I was discharged,
I bought a new phone.

168
00:13:49,560 --> 00:13:51,080
You were the first person I called.

169
00:13:51,160 --> 00:13:52,840
How are you now?

170
00:13:52,920 --> 00:13:55,480
Which hospital are you at?
I'll come visit you.

171
00:13:55,560 --> 00:13:58,200
I'm much better now.
I'm already out of the hospital.

172
00:13:58,280 --> 00:14:01,080
I'm actually heading to the police station

173
00:14:01,160 --> 00:14:02,600
to check on the case.

174
00:14:03,680 --> 00:14:06,360
Okay. I'm worried about you.

175
00:14:07,160 --> 00:14:08,400
Hathai.

176
00:14:09,840 --> 00:14:10,920
I miss you.

177
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:12,200
Mom.

178
00:14:12,280 --> 00:14:13,320
I have to go.

179
00:14:13,400 --> 00:14:16,680
My friend, who's
a police superintendent, is calling.

180
00:14:16,760 --> 00:14:17,920
Mom.

181
00:14:19,920 --> 00:14:22,560
-Who are you talking to?
-Just a friend.

182
00:14:23,600 --> 00:14:25,000
Heading to the office now?

183
00:14:25,880 --> 00:14:27,360
I'll go help you.

184
00:14:29,480 --> 00:14:30,880
I'll open it for you.

185
00:14:30,960 --> 00:14:32,640
Calm down.

186
00:14:32,720 --> 00:14:36,480
Hathai said you're putting on
an act, madam.

187
00:14:36,560 --> 00:14:40,040
She figured it out.
She knows you're lying.

188
00:14:40,680 --> 00:14:41,760
I know, Chamoi.

189
00:14:44,000 --> 00:14:46,280
Stop sticking your nose into everything.

190
00:14:46,360 --> 00:14:48,800
At the station,
you lied about having a video.

191
00:14:48,880 --> 00:14:50,720
What if she actually asked to see it?

192
00:14:50,800 --> 00:14:53,680
Oh, madam. I can talk
my way out of anything.

193
00:14:53,760 --> 00:14:56,080
When it comes to making excuses,
you can trust me.

194
00:14:56,160 --> 00:15:00,120
Honestly, I probably
shouldn't have become a maid.

195
00:15:00,200 --> 00:15:01,720
Then what should you be?

196
00:15:01,800 --> 00:15:05,200
If you're this good at talking nonsense
and making excuses,

197
00:15:05,280 --> 00:15:07,120
you should be a politician.

198
00:15:10,120 --> 00:15:11,360
Madam.

199
00:15:11,440 --> 00:15:14,880
I think pretending to be nice
and helping them

200
00:15:14,960 --> 00:15:16,560
is not going to make them trust us.

201
00:15:17,160 --> 00:15:20,960
Who cares? I just have to play
the good person for now.

202
00:15:21,040 --> 00:15:22,920
When the time comes, I'll strike.

203
00:15:23,720 --> 00:15:25,640
What are you planning?

204
00:15:27,480 --> 00:15:28,560
To go see Pong.

205
00:15:29,800 --> 00:15:31,960
Every breath she takes is all about Pong.

206
00:15:32,040 --> 00:15:33,760
-Chamoi.
-Yes.

207
00:15:41,960 --> 00:15:45,080
Come on. Faster.

208
00:15:45,160 --> 00:15:46,440
Come on.

209
00:15:46,520 --> 00:15:49,040
Quickly.

210
00:15:49,120 --> 00:15:50,760
Get it done today.

211
00:15:52,440 --> 00:15:53,640
Hey.

212
00:15:53,720 --> 00:15:55,400
What the hell, boss?

213
00:15:55,480 --> 00:15:57,840
I used to box, you know.

214
00:15:57,920 --> 00:16:02,680
You grab me like that
and you'll end up on the ground.

215
00:16:06,360 --> 00:16:10,040
Come on. I'm all man, boss.

216
00:16:10,120 --> 00:16:11,680
Don't look at me like that.

217
00:16:12,240 --> 00:16:15,280
You can't be thinking
those kinds of thoughts.

218
00:16:18,600 --> 00:16:20,720
-What?
-What happened to your face?

219
00:16:22,720 --> 00:16:23,720
Who hit you?

220
00:16:24,320 --> 00:16:25,920
What?

221
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:29,920
Yesterday I took the guys
out for barbecue.

222
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:31,960
Once the alcohol kicked in,
you know how it is.

223
00:16:32,040 --> 00:16:34,960
We got into a little fight
with the table next to us.

224
00:16:35,040 --> 00:16:38,720
I thought you said you used to box.
How did your face end up like that?

225
00:16:39,600 --> 00:16:42,800
Even a boxer can't handle
ten guys at once.

226
00:16:42,880 --> 00:16:46,000
If it had been one-on-one,
he'd have been flat on the ground.

227
00:16:46,080 --> 00:16:48,880
Seriously, boss.

228
00:16:48,960 --> 00:16:51,640
Look at your face.
If I'd been there that night,

229
00:16:51,720 --> 00:16:53,280
none of this would've happened.

230
00:16:53,920 --> 00:16:56,840
Your face would still be handsome.

231
00:16:59,920 --> 00:17:01,760
What?

232
00:17:01,840 --> 00:17:04,000
You're still staring.
Anything else you want to ask?

233
00:17:05,599 --> 00:17:07,200
I'm going to lunch.

234
00:17:07,800 --> 00:17:09,280
I like being on time.

235
00:17:09,359 --> 00:17:12,400
Keep working. I'm going to eat.

236
00:17:13,800 --> 00:17:15,440
I swear he's got a thing for me.

237
00:17:17,160 --> 00:17:19,079
This guy is really annoying, boss.

238
00:17:24,720 --> 00:17:25,880
Same build.

239
00:17:27,119 --> 00:17:28,000
Huh?

240
00:17:28,640 --> 00:17:30,880
What are you thinking, boss?

241
00:17:32,040 --> 00:17:33,280
Max, keep an eye on Pong.

242
00:17:34,840 --> 00:17:36,200
Liu brought him in.

243
00:17:37,480 --> 00:17:38,800
Something's off about him.

244
00:17:41,240 --> 00:17:43,360
Trying to mess with me won't be easy.

245
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:46,400
I should've knocked him
out cold that night.

246
00:18:04,360 --> 00:18:05,640
Yai?

247
00:18:07,320 --> 00:18:09,080
Is that you?

248
00:18:10,120 --> 00:18:11,680
I'm Pong. Right now I'm not Yai.

249
00:18:11,760 --> 00:18:13,240
Yai.

250
00:18:13,320 --> 00:18:15,920
-Why the hell is she calling me?
-Yai.

251
00:18:16,520 --> 00:18:17,600
Yai.

252
00:18:20,680 --> 00:18:21,920
Yai.

253
00:18:22,480 --> 00:18:25,520
Why are you grabbing me, Chamoi?

254
00:18:27,280 --> 00:18:28,240
Oh.

255
00:18:28,840 --> 00:18:30,880
Who are you looking for?

256
00:18:30,960 --> 00:18:34,680
I thought I saw someone I know. Move.

257
00:18:34,760 --> 00:18:37,400
This is a construction site.

258
00:18:37,480 --> 00:18:40,440
It's full of workers.
You only just came back.

259
00:18:40,520 --> 00:18:41,640
Who could you know here?

260
00:18:43,480 --> 00:18:44,720
What's this?

261
00:18:45,320 --> 00:18:47,880
Suddenly coming here looking for workers?

262
00:18:47,960 --> 00:18:49,440
Oh.

263
00:18:49,520 --> 00:18:52,120
So coming back to care for your daughter

264
00:18:52,200 --> 00:18:55,320
was just an excuse. You really came here

265
00:18:55,400 --> 00:18:57,640
to hook up with male workers, didn't you?

266
00:18:57,720 --> 00:19:00,320
Chamoi, shut your mouth.

267
00:19:02,840 --> 00:19:05,520
If you need help finding someone,
just tell me.

268
00:19:05,600 --> 00:19:08,400
I know the workers here pretty well.

269
00:19:08,480 --> 00:19:09,320
Oh.

270
00:19:09,880 --> 00:19:11,280
Was his name Pong?

271
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:13,000
Ugh.

272
00:19:28,760 --> 00:19:30,960
-Madam.
-Hathai came here

273
00:19:31,040 --> 00:19:32,480
to look after her daughter.

274
00:19:32,560 --> 00:19:34,400
From now on, wherever you go
or do anything,

275
00:19:34,480 --> 00:19:35,920
be careful.

276
00:19:36,000 --> 00:19:37,760
Don't get caught or drag me into this.

277
00:19:39,640 --> 00:19:41,800
Yes, madam. I'll be careful.

278
00:19:44,240 --> 00:19:45,800
Go deal with her quickly.

279
00:19:46,760 --> 00:19:48,000
Yes.

280
00:19:51,760 --> 00:19:54,720
Madam, what did you tell him to do?

281
00:19:54,800 --> 00:19:56,600
Can you not ask questions for once?

282
00:19:56,680 --> 00:19:59,640
No. I just want to know.

283
00:19:59,720 --> 00:20:01,920
And what good does knowing do you?

284
00:20:02,000 --> 00:20:05,880
Nothing. I just want to know.

285
00:20:05,960 --> 00:20:08,920
Madam, my parents taught me

286
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:11,680
that people should always keep learning.

287
00:20:13,600 --> 00:20:15,640
That's called learning.

288
00:20:15,720 --> 00:20:19,600
What you do is called being nosy.

289
00:20:19,680 --> 00:20:21,440
Thank you.

290
00:20:23,160 --> 00:20:26,200
Madam. Wow.

291
00:20:26,280 --> 00:20:27,160
That one really hurt.

292
00:20:27,240 --> 00:20:30,440
Please tell me what you're planning.

293
00:20:38,840 --> 00:20:40,560
His build looked exactly the same.

294
00:20:42,000 --> 00:20:43,680
But how could it be him?

295
00:20:44,480 --> 00:20:46,840
Yai owns a travel agency.

296
00:20:53,200 --> 00:20:55,600
I'm only free tonight.

297
00:20:55,680 --> 00:20:57,640
I have to go overseas for several months.

298
00:20:58,320 --> 00:20:59,840
Meet me at the same restaurant.

299
00:21:04,600 --> 00:21:07,800
Mom. I've finished packing up.
Let's go home.

300
00:21:11,200 --> 00:21:12,760
Is something wrong?

301
00:21:13,640 --> 00:21:15,400
Well,

302
00:21:16,080 --> 00:21:19,480
that friend I met last time

303
00:21:19,560 --> 00:21:22,120
hasn't gone overseas yet.

304
00:21:22,200 --> 00:21:25,680
She wants to have dinner with me again.

305
00:21:28,560 --> 00:21:29,640
Go ahead.

306
00:21:31,360 --> 00:21:33,200
-Okay.
-But I'm coming with you.

307
00:21:33,800 --> 00:21:35,440
I want to meet your friend too.

308
00:21:39,000 --> 00:21:41,200
Well, maybe next time.

309
00:21:41,280 --> 00:21:43,760
She had

310
00:21:44,520 --> 00:21:46,320
an argument with her husband,

311
00:21:46,400 --> 00:21:48,760
so she wants to have dinner alone

312
00:21:48,840 --> 00:21:51,480
with me and talk privately.

313
00:21:54,320 --> 00:21:56,960
Then I'll go now.

314
00:22:11,760 --> 00:22:14,600
Ramil.

315
00:22:16,760 --> 00:22:17,880
Are you busy?

316
00:22:23,760 --> 00:22:25,080
You want to follow your mom?

317
00:22:27,040 --> 00:22:30,600
Aunt Ann told me Mom
has been talking to a man.

318
00:22:30,680 --> 00:22:34,240
I asked her about him before,
but I still don't know much.

319
00:22:34,880 --> 00:22:36,240
I fear she'll get tricked again.

320
00:23:32,520 --> 00:23:33,640
Please sit down.

321
00:23:44,400 --> 00:23:47,280
Mom came this way.
She must be going to the restaurant.

322
00:23:47,360 --> 00:23:48,320
Come on.

323
00:23:55,040 --> 00:23:56,280
Where's Mom?

324
00:24:07,480 --> 00:24:08,320
Yai.

325
00:24:08,920 --> 00:24:11,560
Why change your mind
and sneak me out the back?

326
00:24:11,640 --> 00:24:12,680
Is something wrong?

327
00:24:36,800 --> 00:24:39,720
Pong. Hathaya and Ramil

328
00:24:39,800 --> 00:24:41,960
are following Hathai.

329
00:24:42,040 --> 00:24:43,160
Don't let them catch you.

330
00:24:45,680 --> 00:24:48,280
Is something wrong?

331
00:24:49,080 --> 00:24:51,600
The police superintendent just called me.

332
00:24:51,680 --> 00:24:53,000
He said they caught the thief.

333
00:24:55,000 --> 00:24:56,000
-Really?
-Yes.

334
00:24:56,080 --> 00:24:58,240
He's bringing the recovered property
to me.

335
00:24:58,320 --> 00:25:00,000
Now I can give you the necklace

336
00:25:00,080 --> 00:25:01,280
I bought for you.

337
00:25:01,360 --> 00:25:02,440
-Come on.
-Alright.

338
00:25:10,880 --> 00:25:13,600
If we're meeting the superintendent,

339
00:25:13,680 --> 00:25:16,120
shouldn't we go to the police station?

340
00:25:16,200 --> 00:25:17,840
I told you before.

341
00:25:17,920 --> 00:25:19,600
I'm close with important people.

342
00:25:19,680 --> 00:25:21,720
He'll bring it to me here.

343
00:25:21,800 --> 00:25:24,680
Then can we wait around here?

344
00:25:26,200 --> 00:25:28,040
I'm a VIP member.

345
00:25:28,120 --> 00:25:31,080
I think we should wait
in that room over there.

346
00:25:37,480 --> 00:25:39,160
I know you don't like gambling.

347
00:25:39,800 --> 00:25:41,680
So we'll just sit and relax over there.

348
00:25:42,280 --> 00:25:43,360
Come on.

349
00:25:57,440 --> 00:26:00,000
What would you like? Wine or whiskey?

350
00:26:09,080 --> 00:26:12,280
I don't feel good about this.
I have no idea where Mom went.

351
00:26:12,360 --> 00:26:13,640
Maybe she changed restaurants.

352
00:26:14,520 --> 00:26:15,960
Try calling her.

353
00:26:26,280 --> 00:26:27,320
HATHAYA

354
00:26:28,280 --> 00:26:31,480
My daughter's calling. I should answer.

355
00:26:31,560 --> 00:26:32,560
She'll worry.

356
00:26:48,720 --> 00:26:51,560
I can't reach Mom anymore.

357
00:26:51,640 --> 00:26:53,480
Why would she turn off her phone?

358
00:26:55,800 --> 00:26:57,080
Your mom said

359
00:26:57,160 --> 00:26:59,160
she was meeting a friend
about something private.

360
00:26:59,240 --> 00:27:02,160
Maybe it's important and she can't answer.

361
00:27:04,520 --> 00:27:07,080
But I can't contact her.
Of course I'm worried.

362
00:27:07,680 --> 00:27:13,120
Come on. She said she wouldn't
do anything wrong again. Don't worry.

363
00:27:13,720 --> 00:27:15,240
Let's go home first.

364
00:27:24,160 --> 00:27:26,160
This is a private area.

365
00:27:26,800 --> 00:27:28,920
We have a strict rule
against answering phones.

366
00:27:30,560 --> 00:27:31,920
Yai,

367
00:27:32,000 --> 00:27:34,240
has the superintendent arrived yet?

368
00:27:34,320 --> 00:27:36,360
I want to go home.

369
00:27:36,440 --> 00:27:38,400
He messaged me.

370
00:27:38,480 --> 00:27:41,120
He already left and should be here soon.

371
00:27:43,240 --> 00:27:44,840
Hathai.

372
00:27:44,920 --> 00:27:47,040
You're going to be so excited

373
00:27:48,600 --> 00:27:50,360
when you see the diamond necklace.

374
00:27:52,600 --> 00:27:54,600
Can we do this another day?

375
00:27:54,680 --> 00:27:56,200
I think we should go.

376
00:28:02,240 --> 00:28:04,720
-Hello, Yai.
-Hello, sir.

377
00:28:05,840 --> 00:28:09,000
The minister couldn't stop
praising you the other day.

378
00:28:09,080 --> 00:28:11,080
He said you took excellent care of him.

379
00:28:12,160 --> 00:28:13,080
Where are you heading?

380
00:28:13,160 --> 00:28:15,600
I arranged to meet the superintendent,

381
00:28:15,680 --> 00:28:19,080
but he hasn't arrived yet,
and my girlfriend

382
00:28:19,160 --> 00:28:20,680
wants to go home.

383
00:28:21,280 --> 00:28:24,520
The minister called me
and said he's almost here.

384
00:28:24,600 --> 00:28:25,960
While you wait,

385
00:28:26,840 --> 00:28:28,400
why not play a game or two?

386
00:28:31,760 --> 00:28:35,600
Mr. Wichian is the chief's aide.
Please stay a little longer.

387
00:28:36,920 --> 00:28:38,040
It won't be long.

388
00:28:43,040 --> 00:28:43,880
Come on.

389
00:28:46,080 --> 00:28:47,040
Just one game.

390
00:28:49,480 --> 00:28:51,440
Look at this.

391
00:29:16,840 --> 00:29:17,840
Wow.

392
00:29:21,560 --> 00:29:22,400
All this.

393
00:29:38,240 --> 00:29:39,800
I'm going to the restroom.

394
00:29:39,880 --> 00:29:42,520
I'll be back. Play for me while I'm gone.

395
00:29:58,680 --> 00:29:59,960
Oh my!

396
00:30:02,840 --> 00:30:03,960
-Hey.
-I did it.

397
00:30:04,040 --> 00:30:06,800
You're really lucky.

398
00:30:07,560 --> 00:30:10,840
You're good enough to beat the pros.

399
00:30:11,480 --> 00:30:12,800
You should keep playing for me.

400
00:30:13,640 --> 00:30:16,760
I'd rather not. I'm afraid I'll lose.

401
00:30:16,840 --> 00:30:19,640
Don't be afraid. You're lucky. Trust me.

402
00:30:19,720 --> 00:30:21,000
Put it all in.

403
00:31:00,480 --> 00:31:01,880
I'm sorry.

404
00:31:01,960 --> 00:31:04,520
I lost all your money.

405
00:31:06,200 --> 00:31:09,480
It's nothing. That's pocket change to me.

406
00:31:12,760 --> 00:31:13,640
I want another chance.

407
00:31:25,040 --> 00:31:26,920
May I have your ID card?

408
00:31:34,040 --> 00:31:36,600
I left mine in the car.

409
00:31:36,680 --> 00:31:38,320
Can I borrow yours for a moment?

410
00:31:41,120 --> 00:31:43,040
What for?

411
00:31:43,120 --> 00:31:46,200
I'm going to get
five million baht in chips.

412
00:31:46,280 --> 00:31:49,200
-Five million?
-Yes.

413
00:31:51,080 --> 00:31:52,680
Don't worry.

414
00:31:52,760 --> 00:31:57,200
Your ID is only being used as collateral
so I can withdraw five million in chips.

415
00:31:57,280 --> 00:32:00,400
I'm the one taking the chips. I'm the one
responsible for paying it back.

416
00:32:01,200 --> 00:32:05,240
There are procedures
they have to follow. Don't worry.

417
00:32:07,480 --> 00:32:10,200
It won't bind you to anything. I promise.

418
00:32:36,440 --> 00:32:37,720
Thank you.

419
00:32:42,920 --> 00:32:45,480
Thank you so much, Hathai.

420
00:32:51,560 --> 00:32:52,640
Here are the chips.

421
00:32:55,320 --> 00:32:57,360
Come on. Let's win it back.

422
00:33:04,560 --> 00:33:07,080
It's late, and I still can't reach Mom.

423
00:33:08,680 --> 00:33:12,760
If you're worried, we can go back
to that same place and look again.

424
00:33:12,840 --> 00:33:14,760
I think Mom went somewhere else.

425
00:33:15,520 --> 00:33:18,240
I'm always putting you through
so much. I'm sorry.

426
00:33:19,520 --> 00:33:20,560
It's fine.

427
00:33:21,960 --> 00:33:22,960
I'm happy to help.

428
00:33:29,240 --> 00:33:32,040
You should go home and rest.

429
00:33:33,040 --> 00:33:34,760
Thank you for everything today.

430
00:33:35,600 --> 00:33:36,600
All right.

431
00:33:37,280 --> 00:33:38,520
But

432
00:33:39,640 --> 00:33:40,760
don't stress too much.

433
00:33:43,120 --> 00:33:44,880
Have some faith in your mom.

434
00:33:44,960 --> 00:33:47,880
I believe she won't do anything wrong.

435
00:33:50,280 --> 00:33:51,600
And if anything happens,

436
00:33:52,520 --> 00:33:54,840
call me anytime.

437
00:33:56,760 --> 00:33:58,080
Okay.

438
00:33:59,120 --> 00:34:00,320
Then I'll go.

439
00:35:36,600 --> 00:35:37,920
After you.

440
00:35:46,240 --> 00:35:47,880
I'm so sorry.

441
00:35:47,960 --> 00:35:50,360
I lost all five million of your money.

442
00:35:51,520 --> 00:35:53,000
It's fine.

443
00:35:53,080 --> 00:35:54,840
Five million is nothing to me.

444
00:35:55,440 --> 00:35:57,280
If I get to stand beside you,

445
00:35:58,000 --> 00:35:59,760
that alone makes me happy.

446
00:36:01,200 --> 00:36:02,640
Come on. Let's go.

447
00:36:06,480 --> 00:36:07,560
Yai.

448
00:36:08,120 --> 00:36:09,920
The boss wants the money back tomorrow.

449
00:36:10,560 --> 00:36:11,760
What is this?

450
00:36:12,480 --> 00:36:14,440
It's only five million.

451
00:36:14,520 --> 00:36:16,760
I normally take ten or 20 million in chips

452
00:36:17,520 --> 00:36:18,800
and there's never a problem.

453
00:36:19,560 --> 00:36:20,880
And let me make something clear.

454
00:36:20,960 --> 00:36:22,920
I've never defaulted on a debt.

455
00:36:23,000 --> 00:36:25,360
But today it isn't under your name.

456
00:36:25,440 --> 00:36:27,880
Then tell your boss those chips

457
00:36:27,960 --> 00:36:30,880
are under my woman's name.

458
00:36:42,640 --> 00:36:44,320
I'm sorry.

459
00:36:44,400 --> 00:36:46,560
I never meant to make you lose that money.

460
00:36:47,200 --> 00:36:48,280
It's fine.

461
00:36:48,360 --> 00:36:50,880
I'll transfer the money tomorrow,
then it's over.

462
00:36:51,640 --> 00:36:52,880
So,

463
00:36:53,680 --> 00:36:55,080
sleep well tonight.

464
00:36:56,040 --> 00:36:57,200
Okay.

465
00:37:01,400 --> 00:37:04,160
But why didn't the superintendent

466
00:37:04,240 --> 00:37:07,960
bring you the diamond necklace
like he was supposed to today?

467
00:37:09,200 --> 00:37:13,280
He called me while I was in the restroom.

468
00:37:13,360 --> 00:37:14,960
He couldn't make it

469
00:37:15,040 --> 00:37:16,480
because something came up with a case.

470
00:37:17,200 --> 00:37:18,440
Don't worry.

471
00:37:18,520 --> 00:37:21,520
Tomorrow I'll go to his house
and pick up the necklace.

472
00:37:21,600 --> 00:37:24,280
Then I'll come back

473
00:37:25,000 --> 00:37:26,920
and put it around your neck myself.

474
00:37:27,560 --> 00:37:28,480
Okay?

475
00:37:29,400 --> 00:37:30,720
Okay.

476
00:37:30,800 --> 00:37:33,200
Can I ask you one thing?

477
00:37:34,880 --> 00:37:37,080
Please don't tell your daughter yet.

478
00:37:38,200 --> 00:37:39,560
Why?

479
00:37:39,640 --> 00:37:41,920
I want my daughter to meet you.

480
00:37:42,840 --> 00:37:44,040
I want it to be a surprise.

481
00:37:44,840 --> 00:37:46,880
I want your daughter to be excited

482
00:37:46,960 --> 00:37:48,840
when she finds out

483
00:37:48,920 --> 00:37:51,160
her mother is going
to marry a billionaire.

484
00:37:55,520 --> 00:37:56,720
Good night.

485
00:38:00,200 --> 00:38:01,440
Yes.

486
00:38:29,720 --> 00:38:31,120
Who brought you home, Mom?

487
00:38:31,200 --> 00:38:33,080
I saw it was a man.

488
00:38:34,800 --> 00:38:36,200
That was my friend's husband.

489
00:38:36,280 --> 00:38:38,240
My friend was in the car too.

490
00:38:39,840 --> 00:38:42,680
I'm sorry I got home so late.

491
00:38:43,920 --> 00:38:45,080
Come on. Let's go to bed.

492
00:38:45,160 --> 00:38:47,440
Mom. Where were you?

493
00:38:47,520 --> 00:38:49,480
I followed you earlier
and couldn't find you.

494
00:38:51,080 --> 00:38:53,600
You followed me?

495
00:38:53,680 --> 00:38:55,520
No.

496
00:38:55,600 --> 00:38:58,280
I stopped by to eat with Ramil.

497
00:38:58,360 --> 00:39:00,080
I saw you walking into a restaurant.

498
00:39:00,160 --> 00:39:03,160
But when I followed you in, you were gone.

499
00:39:03,880 --> 00:39:05,640
My friend

500
00:39:05,720 --> 00:39:08,480
changed her mind,
so we changed restaurants.

501
00:39:09,800 --> 00:39:11,320
So,

502
00:39:11,400 --> 00:39:14,520
you don't trust me, do you?

503
00:39:14,600 --> 00:39:17,680
You think I must've gone off
and done something bad again.

504
00:39:19,480 --> 00:39:20,680
How about

505
00:39:20,760 --> 00:39:24,120
I just stay in my room
and never go anywhere?

506
00:39:24,200 --> 00:39:25,680
Would that make you feel better?

507
00:39:25,760 --> 00:39:28,360
Mom, that's not what I meant.

508
00:39:28,440 --> 00:39:30,160
I'm just worried about you.

509
00:39:32,080 --> 00:39:35,240
Do you remember what you promised me?

510
00:39:35,320 --> 00:39:37,480
You said you were going to change.

511
00:39:37,560 --> 00:39:40,720
No more gambling.
No more causing problems.

512
00:39:42,400 --> 00:39:45,200
Of course I remember. I haven't forgotten.

513
00:39:46,040 --> 00:39:47,160
Let's go to bed. It's late.

514
00:39:57,120 --> 00:39:58,520
You've fallen for her, huh?

515
00:39:59,200 --> 00:40:00,120
No.

516
00:40:01,120 --> 00:40:04,160
I saw you kissing her goodbye.

517
00:40:04,240 --> 00:40:06,080
I was just staying in character.

518
00:40:06,160 --> 00:40:07,680
I already told you.

519
00:40:07,760 --> 00:40:09,480
I'm a professional.

520
00:40:09,560 --> 00:40:12,080
A professional doesn't
fall in love with the target.

521
00:40:13,520 --> 00:40:14,520
Good.

522
00:40:16,840 --> 00:40:18,040
Are you jealous?

523
00:40:20,360 --> 00:40:22,480
Dream on. Someone like me

524
00:40:22,560 --> 00:40:24,640
would never fall for an employee.

525
00:40:27,640 --> 00:40:29,080
Sure.

526
00:40:31,720 --> 00:40:33,800
Keep the plan moving.

527
00:40:33,880 --> 00:40:35,880
I already prepared something for you.

528
00:40:40,920 --> 00:40:43,480
-Oh. Please sit down.
-Alright.

529
00:40:45,440 --> 00:40:48,760
Yai, you said it was urgent.
Is something wrong?

530
00:40:49,920 --> 00:40:51,240
I'm a man of my word.

531
00:40:56,840 --> 00:40:59,160
My most precious piece.

532
00:40:59,240 --> 00:41:01,040
The most expensive one in my collection.

533
00:41:03,400 --> 00:41:04,600
For you.

534
00:41:05,600 --> 00:41:06,880
Wow.

535
00:41:07,560 --> 00:41:09,320
It's beautiful.

536
00:41:10,160 --> 00:41:13,040
This must have been very expensive.

537
00:41:13,640 --> 00:41:15,200
The price doesn't matter.

538
00:41:15,920 --> 00:41:19,160
For you, I'll find a way to get anything.

539
00:41:21,200 --> 00:41:22,960
But Hathai,

540
00:41:23,840 --> 00:41:25,680
keep it safe. Put it in your bag.

541
00:41:26,720 --> 00:41:28,920
If a thief sees it, or anyone else sees it

542
00:41:29,600 --> 00:41:31,400
and gets greedy,

543
00:41:32,160 --> 00:41:33,640
they might rob you.

544
00:41:33,720 --> 00:41:35,320
Just like what happened to me.

545
00:41:38,960 --> 00:41:40,360
Put it in your bag.

546
00:41:46,760 --> 00:41:48,000
Would you like anything to eat?

547
00:41:48,960 --> 00:41:50,360
Should we order something?

548
00:41:59,640 --> 00:42:01,920
Yai, is something wrong?

549
00:42:03,640 --> 00:42:06,360
Well…

550
00:42:09,720 --> 00:42:10,800
Huh?

551
00:42:12,120 --> 00:42:13,840
He's one of the boss's debt collectors.

552
00:42:13,920 --> 00:42:15,240
So,

553
00:42:15,320 --> 00:42:17,320
you still haven't paid them?

554
00:42:20,760 --> 00:42:22,000
The boss sent me to collect.

555
00:42:22,680 --> 00:42:24,640
You said you'd pay by noon today.

556
00:42:24,720 --> 00:42:26,160
Show some respect.

557
00:42:26,760 --> 00:42:28,160
If I said I'll pay, then I will.

558
00:42:30,000 --> 00:42:32,200
What? What are you looking at?

559
00:42:32,280 --> 00:42:34,800
That's Hathai. She has nothing
to do with this.

560
00:42:34,880 --> 00:42:36,360
We follow the law.

561
00:42:37,280 --> 00:42:39,760
The person who signed
the loan pays the debt.

562
00:42:41,800 --> 00:42:44,600
Call your boss. I'll talk to him.

563
00:42:45,320 --> 00:42:47,280
-Call him.
-The boss went to Italy.

564
00:42:47,880 --> 00:42:49,120
Then I'll call him myself.

565
00:42:49,200 --> 00:42:50,920
He isn't taking anyone's calls.

566
00:42:51,000 --> 00:42:54,720
He gave us strict orders
to get the money back.

567
00:42:54,800 --> 00:42:57,600
I don't have that kind of money,
and I didn't take out a loan.

568
00:42:57,680 --> 00:42:59,480
Then whose damn signature is on this?

569
00:43:00,480 --> 00:43:01,280
Hey!

570
00:43:02,840 --> 00:43:04,360
Please be careful.

571
00:43:04,440 --> 00:43:06,520
-Watch out!
-Hathai, run.

572
00:43:06,600 --> 00:43:08,280
Get out of here.

573
00:43:08,840 --> 00:43:10,720
Hey.

574
00:43:10,800 --> 00:43:12,680
Don't.

575
00:43:13,320 --> 00:43:14,920
The necklace is in her bag. Get it.

576
00:43:21,840 --> 00:43:24,400
Hey. Stop.

577
00:43:27,040 --> 00:43:29,520
Give me my purse back.

578
00:43:29,600 --> 00:43:31,320
Give it back.

579
00:43:31,400 --> 00:43:32,760
That's my necklace!

580
00:43:32,840 --> 00:43:34,840
This is the interest.

581
00:43:35,600 --> 00:43:38,600
Go find the rest
of the money and pay it back.

582
00:43:38,680 --> 00:43:41,120
I told you I don't have it.
I don't have any money.

583
00:43:41,200 --> 00:43:42,240
Then go find some.

584
00:43:42,320 --> 00:43:44,720
If I don't have any,
what do you expect me to do?

585
00:43:44,800 --> 00:43:45,680
Then die.

586
00:43:46,720 --> 00:43:47,880
Stay back!

587
00:43:52,720 --> 00:43:54,520
Hathai. Get in.

588
00:43:56,080 --> 00:43:57,040
Stop right there.

589
00:43:57,120 --> 00:43:59,160
-Come on.
-Go.

590
00:43:59,240 --> 00:44:01,720
Yai. Get in quickly.

591
00:44:03,360 --> 00:44:05,920
Go. Go.

592
00:44:06,000 --> 00:44:08,040
Stop. You bastards.

593
00:44:23,320 --> 00:44:24,960
Are you okay?

594
00:44:26,000 --> 00:44:27,040
I'm fine.

595
00:44:27,720 --> 00:44:28,960
I'm more worried about you.

596
00:44:36,760 --> 00:44:38,440
This is Liu, my relative.

597
00:44:39,480 --> 00:44:42,400
Thank you so much, Miss Liu,
for helping us.

598
00:44:43,760 --> 00:44:45,720
I just happened to be driving by.

599
00:44:45,800 --> 00:44:47,800
Of course, I had to help my own relative.

600
00:44:48,880 --> 00:44:51,840
Hathai, what happened?

601
00:44:51,920 --> 00:44:54,160
Why was that thug trying to kill you?

602
00:45:00,120 --> 00:45:04,320
Give me a minute to talk to Yai first.

603
00:45:19,480 --> 00:45:21,600
You said you were close
with those creditors.

604
00:45:21,680 --> 00:45:23,960
So why did they beat you like that?

605
00:45:24,040 --> 00:45:26,320
If the boss had been here,
I could've handled it.

606
00:45:26,400 --> 00:45:28,960
But those guys are just underlings.
They're drunk on power.

607
00:45:29,680 --> 00:45:30,880
I'm sorry

608
00:45:30,960 --> 00:45:32,920
I couldn't get
the diamond necklace for you.

609
00:45:34,280 --> 00:45:36,560
What do we do now?

610
00:45:36,640 --> 00:45:38,080
Should we go to the police?

611
00:45:38,160 --> 00:45:39,680
No.

612
00:45:39,760 --> 00:45:43,080
We owe gambling debt.
We were already breaking the law.

613
00:45:43,160 --> 00:45:45,240
And those people

614
00:45:45,320 --> 00:45:47,280
are connected to a major crime syndicate.

615
00:45:47,360 --> 00:45:50,440
They have connections. If we report them,
they'll make sure we lose.

616
00:45:51,520 --> 00:45:54,160
But there have to be
some good people out there.

617
00:45:54,240 --> 00:45:57,200
And you know so many powerful people.

618
00:45:57,280 --> 00:45:59,160
Surely someone can help us.

619
00:45:59,240 --> 00:46:01,320
That would drag
my business into this mess.

620
00:46:02,040 --> 00:46:06,160
And the senior officer backing me is
under investigation for online gambling.

621
00:46:06,240 --> 00:46:09,040
He has enough trouble of his own. He won't

622
00:46:09,120 --> 00:46:10,360
publicly step in to help me.

623
00:46:11,440 --> 00:46:13,120
Then what are we supposed to do?

624
00:46:13,200 --> 00:46:15,720
I don't have five million to repay them.

625
00:46:16,520 --> 00:46:18,280
Don't worry.

626
00:46:18,360 --> 00:46:21,280
It's only five million.
I can easily find that kind of money.

627
00:46:21,360 --> 00:46:23,760
Then why don't you pay it now?

628
00:46:23,840 --> 00:46:26,080
I want to clear the debt.

629
00:46:26,160 --> 00:46:28,600
I know this sounds like an excuse,

630
00:46:28,680 --> 00:46:31,800
but the powerful partner
who invested in my travel agency

631
00:46:31,880 --> 00:46:34,320
is now tied
to a call-center scam investigation.

632
00:46:34,920 --> 00:46:38,120
Do you know that almost a billion baht
of my money has been frozen?

633
00:46:38,200 --> 00:46:40,200
Then what are we supposed to do?

634
00:46:40,280 --> 00:46:41,920
From what I checked most recently,

635
00:46:42,000 --> 00:46:44,520
I'm not connected to any
of those financial transactions.

636
00:46:44,600 --> 00:46:46,880
So they should release my money soon.

637
00:46:47,680 --> 00:46:49,960
The problem is, it won't be in time.

638
00:46:50,040 --> 00:46:51,040
Could I

639
00:46:51,960 --> 00:46:54,440
borrow five million from you first?

640
00:46:55,240 --> 00:46:56,440
Just for three days.

641
00:46:56,520 --> 00:46:58,480
Once they release all my money,

642
00:46:59,080 --> 00:47:00,680
I'll give you 50 million back.

643
00:47:02,520 --> 00:47:04,680
Hathai. I'm sorry

644
00:47:04,760 --> 00:47:06,320
for putting you in this position.

645
00:47:07,360 --> 00:47:08,520
It's only three days.

646
00:47:15,760 --> 00:47:16,720
Hello, sir.

647
00:47:17,840 --> 00:47:19,200
Yes.

648
00:47:20,960 --> 00:47:24,120
Really? The order has already been signed?

649
00:47:24,720 --> 00:47:26,240
Thank you so much, sir.

650
00:47:26,320 --> 00:47:28,680
Thank you for helping me.

651
00:47:29,680 --> 00:47:31,840
See? My assets are no longer frozen.

652
00:47:31,920 --> 00:47:33,640
I'll get my money back soon.

653
00:47:34,800 --> 00:47:36,200
So,

654
00:47:37,400 --> 00:47:38,880
please lend me the five million first.

655
00:47:38,960 --> 00:47:42,320
I know you love me.

656
00:47:43,160 --> 00:47:44,960
You know where to bring the money.

657
00:47:45,760 --> 00:47:48,800
The same place. I have to go now.

658
00:48:08,720 --> 00:48:10,600
Why did you help me?

659
00:48:12,960 --> 00:48:15,360
I'm not saying I want us
to suddenly be close,

660
00:48:16,040 --> 00:48:17,720
but how could I

661
00:48:17,800 --> 00:48:19,600
watch family die right in front of me?

662
00:48:20,280 --> 00:48:21,720
Thank you.

663
00:48:22,880 --> 00:48:24,080
Thank you so much.

664
00:48:26,240 --> 00:48:28,720
Are you going to tell me
what happened now?

665
00:48:32,880 --> 00:48:37,200
But if you still think of me
as your enemy, then forget it.

666
00:48:46,800 --> 00:48:48,160
I'll tell you.

667
00:48:49,760 --> 00:48:51,200
Then tell me what happened.

668
00:48:51,840 --> 00:48:53,480
And tell me if I can do anything.

669
00:49:07,960 --> 00:49:10,120
What are you thinking about?

670
00:49:13,680 --> 00:49:16,160
It's Pong.

671
00:49:17,200 --> 00:49:20,000
The night it happened, someone called me.

672
00:49:22,080 --> 00:49:25,200
But when I went out there,
nothing had happened at all.

673
00:49:25,280 --> 00:49:27,280
So I can't stop thinking that

674
00:49:27,360 --> 00:49:30,320
what happened could be connected

675
00:49:31,440 --> 00:49:32,640
to whoever attacked you.

676
00:49:36,280 --> 00:49:38,240
Wait until Hathai and Hathaya

677
00:49:38,320 --> 00:49:40,720
get kicked out of the house.

678
00:49:40,800 --> 00:49:42,840
Your mom is deep in gambling debt.

679
00:49:42,920 --> 00:49:44,760
‎NEXT EPISODE

680
00:49:46,400 --> 00:49:49,160
-Give me the bag.
-And what if I don't?

681
00:49:49,760 --> 00:49:50,920
What are you going to do about it, madam?

682
00:49:51,000 --> 00:49:53,440
He isn't some wealthy tycoon,
and his name isn't Yai either.

683
00:49:54,320 --> 00:49:55,680
His name is Pong.

684
00:49:55,760 --> 00:49:56,600
I'm sorry.

685
00:49:58,960 --> 00:50:01,200
Can you forgive me?

686
00:50:02,240 --> 00:50:03,680
Mom did something wrong.

687
00:50:04,360 --> 00:50:06,400
So I'll leave this house with her.

688
00:51:58,960 --> 00:52:02,680
Subtitle translation by: Thanit Puncharoen

689
00:52:02,680 --> 00:52:03,680

